# Cloudflare Pages redirects (BO-SMC-WEBSITE-V1).
#
# NOTE: www -> apex canonical is NOT done here. Cloudflare Pages _redirects only
# supports same-host path redirects (relative targets); a cross-host www->apex 301
# with an absolute URL is rejected at deploy ("Only relative URLs are allowed") and
# silently skipped. This is also how AJB does it: its _redirects holds only path
# redirects, and www->apex lives as a Cloudflare Redirect Rule at the zone level.
#
# www -> apex for smatthewcohen.com is a dashboard Redirect Rule (see README / ship note),
# not a repo file. This file is intentionally rule-free until a real path redirect is needed.
